msgid "U575 synchronous dual-world reference contract"
msgstr "U575 同步双域参考合同"

msgid ""
"This is a software reference for an explicit Secure and NonSecure image pair"
" on STM32U575 with 2 MiB Flash. It is separate from the existing TZEN0 "
"platform profile. It does not turn that profile into a TrustZone provider, "
"integrate a NonSecure RTOS, authenticate firmware, or establish physical "
"isolation evidence. No board has executed this reference yet."
msgstr ""
"这是 2 MiB Flash STM32U575 上显式 Secure／NonSecure 镜像对的软件参考，独立于既有 TZEN0 "
"平台配置。它不把该配置变成 TrustZone 提供者，不集成 NonSecure RTOS，不认证固件，也不建立物理隔离证据。尚无实板执行此参考。"

msgid "Ownership and assembly"
msgstr "所有权与装配"

msgid ""
"`soc/stm32u575/security.c` implements the cold-owner mechanism. Its private "
"`nx_stm32u575_tz_layout_t` contains caller-selected spans, not a platform-"
"owned product partition. The owner lives in Secure SRAM1 and remains "
"allocated until reset. The boot owner supplies mutually consistent linker "
"scripts, vectors, Secure fault handlers, partition parameters and image-"
"loading policy."
msgstr ""
"`soc/stm32u575/security.c` 实现冷态所有者机制。私有 `nx_stm32u575_tz_layout_t` "
"包含调用方选定范围，不是平台持有的产品分区。Owner 位于 Secure SRAM1 并保留至 reset。启动 owner "
"提供相互一致的链接脚本、向量、Secure fault handler、分区参数及镜像加载策略。"

msgid ""
"`tests/contracts/u575_trustzone` is the explicit reference assembly. It owns"
" the example partition, a single fixed NonSecure-world principal and a PC7 "
"GPIO grant. Its two Runtime builds produce separate ELFs, a real SG veneer "
"and Secure import library, and an actual compiler-generated NonSecure call. "
"The reference does not use the TZEN0 SoC startup or claim generated factory "
"integration."
msgstr ""
"`tests/contracts/u575_trustzone` 是显式参考装配，持有示例分区、唯一固定 NonSecure-world 主体及 PC7"
" GPIO 授权。两个 Runtime 构建生成独立 ELF、真实 SG veneer／Secure import library 和编译器生成的真实 "
"NonSecure 调用。参考不使用 TZEN0 SoC startup，也不声明生成 factory 集成。"

msgid ""
"Cold preflight performs observations without owner updates or configuration "
"writes. This does not promise that all hardware reads are side-effect free: "
"reading SysTick CTRL observes and clears COUNTFLAG. The trusted cold "
"contract starts with no running timer. Preflight rejects incompatible "
"geometry, context, option bytes, Flash permissions, active interrupts, "
"autonomous bus masters, caches and floating-point ownership. It requires "
"Secure privileged Thread mode, MSP within the supplied Secure SRAM1 stack, "
"PRIMASK set, and BASEPRI/FAULTMASK clear. The Secure vector table must "
"already be at the Secure bank1 address. A previously running world or a "
"bootloader-owned peripheral configuration is not adopted."
msgstr ""
"冷态预检仅观察，不更新 owner 或写配置，但不承诺所有硬件读取无副作用：读取 SysTick CTRL 会观察并清 "
"COUNTFLAG。可信冷合同要求没有运行 timer。预检拒绝不兼容 geometry、context、option bytes、Flash "
"权限、活动中断、自主 bus master、cache 及浮点所有权。要求 Secure 特权 Thread、MSP 位于所供 Secure SRAM1"
" stack、PRIMASK 已设置且 BASEPRI/FAULTMASK 全清。Secure 向量表已在 Secure bank1 地址；不认领已运行"
" world 或 bootloader 持有的外设配置。"

msgid ""
"After admission the owner records FAILED and effects=true before enabling "
"the GTZC/SYSCFG clocks. Any later failure keeps that state and requires "
"reset; there is no rollback, retry or release promise. Only complete "
"configuration and readback publish READY. Successful entry publishes RUNNING"
" before the actual CMSE transition. The production transition never returns;"
" an unexpected NS return enters terminal fault handling."
msgstr ""
"准入后，在使能 GTZC/SYSCFG 时钟前记录 FAILED 和 effects=true。后续任何失败保留该状态并要求 reset，无 "
"rollback、retry 或 release 承诺。只有完整配置及读回才发布 READY；成功进入在真实 CMSE 转换前发布 "
"RUNNING。生产转换不返回，意外 NS 返回进入终止 fault 处理。"

msgid "Attribution and memory"
msgstr "归属与内存"

msgid ""
"The mechanism accepts page-aligned NS Flash within bank2, superblock-aligned"
" NS SRAM within SRAM3, NSC within Secure bank1 outside its first vector "
"page, and a Secure stack within SRAM1's Secure alias. At least one SRAM3 "
"superblock remains Secure so its clock/reset attribution remains Secure with"
" INVSECSTATE clear."
msgstr ""
"机制接纳 bank2 中 page-aligned NS Flash、SRAM3 中 superblock-aligned NS SRAM、Secure"
" bank1 首向量页外的 NSC，以及 SRAM1 Secure alias 中的 Secure stack。至少一个 SRAM3 "
"superblock 保持 Secure，以便时钟／reset 归属仍为 Secure 且 INVSECSTATE 清零。"

msgid ""
"The current hardware admission is intentionally narrow: TZEN=1, SWAP_BANK=0,"
" 2 MiB Flash, SRAM3 ECC disabled, bank1 fully Secure, Secure boot address "
"0x0c000000, no hide protection, no security inversion, Flash programming "
"locked and idle, and the selected bank2 pages neither Secure nor privileged."
" In particular, SRAM3_ECC=1 means ECC disabled. The mechanism never writes "
"option bytes, erases Flash, or programs images. Provisioning must establish "
"this boot contract before execution; a late register check cannot "
"retroactively protect instructions already executed."
msgstr ""
"当前硬件准入刻意收窄：TZEN=1、SWAP_BANK=0、2 MiB Flash、SRAM3 ECC disabled、bank1 全 "
"Secure、Secure boot 地址 0x0c000000、无 hide protection／security inversion、Flash "
"编程锁定且 idle、所选 bank2 页既非 Secure 也非 privileged。特别是 SRAM3_ECC=1 表示 ECC "
"disabled。机制绝不写 option bytes、擦 Flash 或编程镜像。Provisioning "
"必须在执行前建立此启动合同；迟到寄存器校验不能追溯保护已执行指令。"

msgid ""
"After verifying actual SRAM1/SRAM3 security and privilege configuration, the"
" mechanism zeroes the future NS RAM through its still-Secure alias and reads"
" it back before declassification. It then makes only the selected SRAM3 "
"superblocks NonSecure and unprivileged. SRAM1 remains Secure and privileged."
" It locks the implemented SRAM1 and SRAM3 superblocks and the corresponding "
"global MPCBB configuration until reset. CMSE checks alone do not establish "
"these bus-firewall permissions: GTZC unprivileged denials may read as zero "
"or ignore writes."
msgstr ""
"校验实际 SRAM1/SRAM3 security／privilege 后，机制通过仍为 Secure 的 alias 清零未来 NS RAM "
"并读回，再降为 NonSecure。只把所选 SRAM3 superblock 改为 NonSecure／unprivileged，SRAM1 保持 "
"Secure／privileged。实现的 SRAM1／SRAM3 superblock 及对应全局 MPCBB 配置锁定至 reset。CMSE "
"检查自身不能建立这些总线防火墙权限：GTZC 非特权拒绝可能读取零或忽略写。"

msgid ""
"The SAU enables exactly three spans: NS Flash, NS RAM and NSC at its Secure "
"Flash alias. All remaining addresses retain Secure attribution. The NS MPU "
"provides read-only executable Flash and read/write execute-never RAM, with "
"no privileged default map or peripheral region. MAIR uses normal non-"
"cacheable memory. Unused regions are disabled. Actual MPU TYPE is read: this"
" mechanism accepts 8 or 16 regions and clears all observed regions, "
"rejecting other counts. This is not a claim that every U575 revision "
"implements 16 regions: RM0456 states eight, whereas DS13737 describes up to "
"sixteen. The existing TZEN0 provider separately maintains an exact eight-"
"region CPU tuple. Protected FreeRTOS preserves its exact comparison with "
"hardware TYPE and rejects an actual sixteen-region configuration rather than"
" silently interpreting the field as a lower bound. The no-OS dual-world "
"mapper's observed region count does not change that contract."
msgstr ""
"SAU 精确使能三个范围：NS Flash、NS RAM、Secure Flash alias 上的 NSC，其余地址仍归 Secure。NS MPU "
"提供只读可执行 Flash 和读写不可执行 RAM，没有 privileged default map 或外设 region；MAIR 用 normal"
" non-cacheable。未用 region 关闭。读取真实 MPU TYPE，接纳 8 或 16 region 并清除全部已观察 "
"region，拒绝其他数量。这不宣称每个 U575 修订都有 16 region：RM0456 写八，DS13737 描述最多十六。既有 TZEN0 "
"提供者独立维护精确八-region CPU tuple。受保护 FreeRTOS 对真实 TYPE 保持精确比较，实际十六 region "
"时拒绝，不把字段静默解释为下限。无 OS 双域 mapper 的观察数量不改变该合同。"

msgid ""
"NSC instruction fetch does not require an additional NS MPU region. Arm "
"DDI0553B.z `ValidateAddress()` selects the MPU for instruction fetch from "
"the resolved security attribution: `secureMpu = !sAttrib.ns`. An NSC address"
" has Secure attribution, so its SG fetch is checked using the Secure MPU and"
" Secure privilege state. This reference requires the Secure MPU disabled and"
" Secure Thread privileged; it does not grant NS ordinary data access to NSC."
msgstr ""
"NSC 取指不需要额外 NS MPU region。Arm DDI0553B.z `ValidateAddress()` 按解析的安全归属选取指 "
"MPU：`secureMpu = !sAttrib.ns`。NSC 属 Secure，所以 SG fetch 经 Secure MPU 与 Secure"
" privilege 检查。此参考要求 Secure MPU disabled、Secure Thread privileged，不授予 NS 对 "
"NSC 的普通数据访问。"

msgid ""
"After readback, SYSCFG locks NS VTOR, the documented NS MPU controls, SAU "
"and the Secure VTOR/AIRCR security routing. RM0456 explicitly lists "
"MPU_CTRL_NS, MPU_RNR_NS and MPU_RBAR_NS for LOCKNSMPU; it does not "
"explicitly list every MPU alias, RLAR or MAIR register. The contract "
"therefore does not treat that bit as proof that all MPU words are immutable."
" Final admission rechecks MAIR, the two active regions through the "
"base/alias registers, controls, locks, physical SRAM permissions, Flash "
"permissions and quiescent interrupt/master state without rewriting a locked "
"region selector."
msgstr ""
"读回后 SYSCFG 锁 NS VTOR、文档列明的 NS MPU 控制、SAU 及 Secure VTOR/AIRCR 安全路由。RM0456 对 "
"LOCKNSMPU 明确列 MPU_CTRL_NS、MPU_RNR_NS、MPU_RBAR_NS，未明确列全部 MPU alias、RLAR 或 "
"MAIR。因此合同不把该位当全部 MPU word 不可变证明。最终准入不重写锁定 region selector，复查 MAIR、经 "
"base/alias 寄存器的两个活动 region、control／lock、物理 SRAM／Flash 权限及静止中断／master。"

msgid ""
"The remaining privilege boundary is mandatory: NS enters unprivileged Thread"
" mode with no NS kernel or privileged exception handler. The immutable NS "
"vector table contains only MSP and Reset; every other implemented exception "
"vector is zero. All interrupt target bits and fault routing remain Secure. "
"NS cannot use an SVC/IRQ handler to alter attribution. Secure NMI/fault "
"handlers fail stop, and Secure software never changes mappings or enables "
"DMA after the cold seal."
msgstr ""
"余下特权边界是强制条件：NS 进入非特权 Thread，没有 NS kernel 或 privileged exception handler。不可变 "
"NS 向量表仅含 MSP 与 Reset，其他已实现异常向量为零。全部 interrupt target 和 fault routing 保持 "
"Secure。NS 不能通过 SVC／IRQ handler 改归属。Secure NMI/fault handler fail-stop；冷态封存后 "
"Secure 软件绝不改映射或使能 DMA。"

msgid "Synchronous gateway and borrow boundary"
msgstr "同步 gateway 与借用边界"

msgid ""
"The reference SG transport checks an actual NonSecure caller, Thread "
"context, Secure privilege and RUNNING ownership. Identity is the fixed NS "
"world, not a claimed task ID from untrusted input. It preserves and masks NS"
" interrupts through the synchronous call; the Secure broker retains its own "
"documented masking and serialization rules."
msgstr ""
"参考 SG transport 检查真实 NonSecure caller、Thread context、Secure privilege 和 "
"RUNNING ownership。身份是固定 NS world，不是不可信输入宣称的 task ID。同步调用中保存并屏蔽 NS 中断；Secure "
"broker 保持自身合同中的掩码与串行规则。"

msgid ""
"The memory port first restricts a request to the explicit NS RAM span, then "
"uses `nx_arch_nonsecure_check` with real CMSE NonSecure and unprivileged MPU"
" checks. The broker copies a bounded request into Secure storage before "
"acting, checks the fixed GPIO grant, and holds the output mapping until its "
"final copy. The permission check itself is only an observation: it neither "
"copies nor pins memory. The reference's synchronous pin relies on the "
"already established static mapping, lack of NS concurrent "
"execution/handlers, lack of autonomous masters, and exclusive Secure owner. "
"It does not authorize asynchronous loans, DMA buffers, arbitrary MMIO, "
"callbacks or mutable user address spaces. Retained cleanup or an impossible "
"mapping-release failure is terminal."
msgstr ""
"Memory port 先限制请求于显式 NS RAM 范围，再用 `nx_arch_nonsecure_check` 执行真实 CMSE "
"NonSecure／非特权 MPU 检查。Broker 在动作前将有界请求复制到 Secure storage，校验固定 GPIO "
"授权，保留输出映射直到最终复制。权限检查只是观察，既不 copy 也不 pin。参考同步 pin 依赖已建立静态映射、无 NS "
"并发／handler、无自主 master 和独占 Secure owner。它不授权异步借用、DMA buffer、任意 MMIO、callback "
"或可变用户地址空间。保留 cleanup 或不应出现的 mapping-release 失败进入终止路径。"

msgid ""
"No security property is inferred from a host pointer model or the presence "
"of SG/BLXNS opcodes alone. Host Google tests establish software admission "
"and failure behavior; real ARM ELFs establish ABI/link/layout properties. "
"Hardware must still verify attribution, fault delivery, CMSE observations, "
"lock behavior, GPIO effect, provisioning and the exact board revision."
msgstr ""
"主机指针模型或仅出现 SG/BLXNS opcode 都不能推导安全性质。Host Google 测试建立软件准入与失败行为，真实 ARM ELF 建立"
" ABI／link／layout。硬件仍须验证归属、fault delivery、CMSE 观察、lock、GPIO 效果、provisioning "
"与精确 PCB 修订。"

msgid "Source basis and validation"
msgstr "源码依据与验证"

msgid ""
"The implementation uses locked STM32U5 CMSIS v1.4.3, commit "
"`624374fa1e21ca195d6f2102ac0caaa50d0ea4c8`, and the repository's locked Arm "
"CMSIS. Authoritative register review used ST RM0456 revision 7:"
msgstr ""
"实现使用锁定 STM32U5 CMSIS v1.4.3、commit "
"`624374fa1e21ca195d6f2102ac0caaa50d0ea4c8` 及仓库锁定 Arm CMSIS。权威寄存器审查使用 ST "
"RM0456 revision 7："

msgid "Sections 3.5.2 and 3.7.1: banked MPU and documented region count."
msgstr "3.5.2、3.7.1 节：banked MPU 与文档 region 数量。"

msgid ""
"Sections 5.4.2, 5.4.4, 5.4.6 and 5.8.1–5.8.5: SRAM granularity, privilege, "
"security aliases, clock attribution, MPCBB inversion and reset-only locks."
msgstr ""
"5.4.2、5.4.4、5.4.6、5.8.1–5.8.5 节：SRAM 粒度、privilege、security alias、clock "
"归属、MPCBB inversion 和仅 reset 解锁。"

msgid ""
"Sections 7.5 and 7.9.13: Flash attribution and SRAM3 ECC option polarity."
msgstr "7.5、7.9.13 节：Flash 归属与 SRAM3 ECC option 极性。"

msgid ""
"Sections 7.9.16–7.9.17 and 7.9.29–7.9.34: Secure boot address, watermarks, "
"Secure/privileged Flash block configuration and the exact U575 bank "
"geometry."
msgstr ""
"7.9.16–7.9.17、7.9.29–7.9.34 节：Secure boot 地址、watermark、Secure／privileged "
"Flash block 配置及精确 U575 bank geometry。"

msgid "Sections 11.5 and 13.3.18: RCC/GPIO security ownership."
msgstr "11.5、13.3.18 节：RCC/GPIO 安全所有权。"

msgid "Sections 15.3.4–15.3.5: CPU NonSecure/Secure configuration lock scope."
msgstr "15.3.4–15.3.5 节：CPU NonSecure／Secure 配置锁范围。"

msgid ""
"The reviewed official PDF is "
"<https://www.st.com/resource/en/reference_manual/rm0456-stm32u5-series-"
"armbased-32bit-mcus-stmicroelectronics.pdf>, SHA-256 "
"`6edaaaae0c5d57c58ffc3a576d44e7b62e8d9cd0e495e8f61bab688226fc327c`. The "
"instruction-fetch rule was independently reviewed against Arm DDI0553B.z "
"(2026-02-24), E2.1.419 `ValidateAddress()` pages 2087–2089 and E2.1.296 "
"`MemI[]` page 2044. Official PDF: <https://documentation-"
"service.arm.com/static/699eb70d77ad5021756604d8>, SHA-256 "
"`468594b22cf5a4bae1261f2cd39d5aa51040fbb566be18cc358c169918fd7a72`. The "
"actual compiler CMSE helper may contain architecture-defined FP context "
"instructions even in this soft-float image pair. Admission rejects active FP"
" ownership (both CONTROL.FPCA and CONTROL.SFPA), CPACR enablement and lazy "
"preservation; this is not a claim that the ELF contains no FP-related "
"opcodes. DDI0553B.z C2.4.368 (VLSTM, pages 1177–1178) specifies that SFPA=0 "
"makes that instruction a no-op; SFPA=1 would require coprocessor access. "
"Therefore SFPA-only state is explicitly rejected before acquiring hardware."
msgstr ""
"已审官方 PDF 为 "
"<https://www.st.com/resource/en/reference_manual/rm0456-stm32u5-series-"
"armbased-32bit-mcus-stmicroelectronics.pdf>，SHA-256 "
"`6edaaaae0c5d57c58ffc3a576d44e7b62e8d9cd0e495e8f61bab688226fc327c`。取指规则另据 "
"Arm DDI0553B.z（2026-02-24）E2.1.419 `ValidateAddress()` 2087–2089 页及 E2.1.296"
" `MemI[]` 2044 页独立审查。官方 PDF <https://documentation-"
"service.arm.com/static/699eb70d77ad5021756604d8>，SHA-256 "
"`468594b22cf5a4bae1261f2cd39d5aa51040fbb566be18cc358c169918fd7a72`。即使此镜像对 "
"soft-float，真实编译器 CMSE helper 仍可能含体系结构定义的 FP context 指令。准入拒绝活动 FP "
"所有权（CONTROL.FPCA 和 CONTROL.SFPA）、CPACR 使能及 lazy preservation，不声称 ELF 无 FP 相关"
" opcode。DDI0553B.z C2.4.368（VLSTM，1177–1178 页）规定 SFPA=0 时该指令无效果，SFPA=1 则需 "
"coprocessor access，因此取得硬件前显式拒绝只有 SFPA 的状态。"

msgid ""
"The Google suite compiles the production mapper and substitutes only "
"hardware MMIO, physical RAM and CPU instruction leaves. It covers rejected "
"admission, actual permission layout, every changed configuration-write "
"failure, zeroing failure, irreversible ownership, vector/stack boundaries, "
"forbidden privileged handlers, metadata changes and final transition "
"ownership. The paired ARM gate checks the actual vector words and executable"
" addresses against this contract."
msgstr ""
"Google suite 编译生产 mapper，仅替换硬件 MMIO、物理 RAM 与 CPU "
"指令叶端口，覆盖拒绝准入、实际权限布局、每次配置写失败、清零失败、不可逆所有权、vector/stack 边界、禁止 privileged "
"handler、元数据变化及最终转换所有权。镜像对 ARM 门禁按本合同检查实际向量字及 executable 地址。"
